  "title": "31. Analysis source assembly",
  "description": "Catalog workflow 31. Selected folders/files/parts → eligible triangular parts → deduplication → transformed source snapshot.\n\nDescriptive diagram: stages and values are explained in the inspector; this file does not execute the workflow or capture historical results.\n\nImplementation: src/comparison_scene.cpp.",
